{"id":"6bf592c70e0ef583640abc2181a8c6637cf9de60","axis":"silent","repo":"envoyproxy/envoy","sha":"6bf592c70e0ef583640abc2181a8c6637cf9de60","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"api/envoy/extensions/filters/http/ai_protocol_manager/v3/ai_protocol_manager.proto","lines":["@@ -49,8 +49,8 @@ message AiProtocolManager {","   // pure passthrough.","   ResponseHandling response_handling = 2;"," ","-  // AI filters, in order. They run over a declared AI endpoint's parsed request payload","-  // before it continues down the HTTP filter chain, and require ``request_handling``.","+  // AI filters, in order. They run over every parsed request payload before it continues down the","+  // HTTP filter chain, and require ``request_handling``.","   // [#extension-category: envoy.http.ai_filters]","   repeated config.core.v3.TypedExtensionConfig filters = 3;"," ","@@ -88,6 +88,11 @@ message RequestHandling {","   // route that declared no AI wire contract has nothing to hold its payload","   // to, so a body that fails to parse is forwarded unchanged.","   //","+  // A body that parses runs the :ref:`AI filters","+  // <envoy_v3_api_field_extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.AiProtocolManager.filters>`","+  // with no API declared, and one of them may reject the request. The response runs them only","+  // if one of them detected the request's API.","+  //","   // Only requests that can be held to end of stream are taken: the request must","   // carry a JSON content type (``application/json`` or a ``+json`` suffix) and","   // must not be gRPC or Connect streaming, an upgrade, or a CONNECT. Holding a"],"additions":7,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"changelogs/current/minor_behavior_changes/ai_protocol_manager__ai-filters-on-unconfigured-routes.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@","+The :ref:`AI filters","+<envoy_v3_api_field_extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.AiProtocolManager.filters>`","+now also run on requests parsed under :ref:`parse_unconfigured_routes","+<envoy_v3_api_field_extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.RequestHandling.parse_unconfigured_routes>`,","+so a catch-all route such as a dynamic forward proxy's can rely on schema validation to detect the","+API. A payload that parses is re-serialized like a declared endpoint's unless ``reserialize_body``","+is ``DISABLE``; one that fails to parse is still forwarded unchanged. An API an AI filter detects is","+published as ``envoy.ai.llm_protocol.request`` filter state, and the response then runs the AI","+filters as a declared endpoint's does."],"additions":9,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/http/http_filters/ai_protocol_manager_filter.rst","lines":["@@ -161,6 +161,14 @@ object when unset so upstream filter chains can read the client's API."," Other routes pass through untouched unless :ref:`parse_unconfigured_routes"," <envoy_v3_api_field_extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.RequestHandling.parse_unconfigured_routes>`"," is set, which parses them best-effort and forwards unparseable payloads unchanged.","+A payload that parses runs the AI filters with no API declared, so a single","+catch-all route -- a dynamic forward proxy's, say -- can leave the API to the","+:ref:`schema validation filter <config_http_filters_ai_protocol_manager_schema_validation>`","+to detect. The response runs the AI filters only when one of them detected","+the request's API; other responses on the route are left untouched. Every","+JSON request on such a route is re-serialized unless :ref:`reserialize_body","+<envoy_v3_api_field_extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.RequestHandling.reserialize_body>`","+is ``DISABLE``, which suits AI filters that only read the request."," "," .. code-block:: yaml"," ","@@ -176,14 +184,14 @@ is set, which parses them best-effort and forwards unparseable payloads unchange"," AI filters"," ----------"," ","-After a declared AI endpoint's payload is parsed, and before it is replayed,","-the filter runs the configured :ref:`AI filters","+After a request's payload is parsed, and before it is replayed, the filter","+runs the configured :ref:`AI filters"," <envoy_v3_api_field_extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.AiProtocolManager.filters>`"," in order over the parsed document; they require ``request_handling``. An AI"," filter (category ``envoy.http.ai_filters``)"," may read or modify the document, or reject the request with a local reply.","-Routes without a per-route request declaration, and requests without a body,","-run no AI filters.","+Requests the filter does not parse -- those passed through, those without a","+body, and best-effort payloads that fail to parse -- run no AI filters."," "," Once the AI filters finish, the parsed document is re-serialized as the"," request body by default. With :ref:`reserialize_body","@@ -192,6 +200,10 @@ set to ``DISABLE``, the received body is forwarded byte for byte instead, and"," edits AI filters make to the document are not sent; use it only with AI filters"," that read the request."," ","+A response runs the AI filters when its request was an AI call: a declared","+AI endpoint, or one whose API an AI filter detected. Any other response","+passes through untouched.","+"," .. _config_http_filters_ai_protocol_manager_schema_validation:"," "," Schema validation"],"additions":16,"deletions":4,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/filters/http/ai_protocol_manager/BUILD","lines":["@@ -423,6 +423,7 @@ envoy_cc_library(","     hdrs = [\"request_filter_manager.h\"],","     deps = [","         \":ai_filter_lib\",","+        \":ai_filter_state_lib\",","         \":ai_request_lib\",","         \":buffer_manager_lib\",","         \":filter_pipeline_lib\","],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/filters/http/ai_protocol_manager/filter.cc","lines":["@@ -418,6 +418,7 @@ bool AiProtocolManagerFilter::feedParser(const Buffer::Instance& data, bool end_","   if (end_stream) {","     reque